obs Restored the seed identity control file from stash 2cd667aff26be80745c3fe3340459d00da36b279 and added its call before projection in tools/s/sow_witness.rish.
obs The control checks names, case folding, a bracketed surname pattern, a contact identifier, clean prose, and the withheld-log exclusion. Seven assertions pass. Two weakened scan copies each fail exactly their intended assertion.
obs Binary-carried names and an absent seed directory still read IDENT_CLEAN; these are reported limits. The witness projects before it accepts the real identity scan.
obs All eight original stashes remain. The automatic-stash reader counts seven stashes and one unlanded log, while the manually named stash is outside that reader's filter.
obs The original 20260908.152731 log remains at the recovery gate in REDS %636: its claimed shelf name differs from the shelf actually parked beside it. Its original bytes remain in the stash and in this seat's ignored recovery directory.
