obs Set executable modes on the Codex watcher and loop control. The executable-bit reading fell from 59 to its unchanged ceiling of 57.
obs The watcher header graded C+ 76. A checkpoint precedes its prose repair to A 94, including the two flag meanings, clockout, and the fact that the Codex loop runs bare. Every non-comment line remains identical.
obs This shell lacks rg on PATH. Installed ripgrep 15.1.0 is available under /nix/store/i2s0hsy2zb1pmps4045472s5zn7ng2vv-ripgrep-15.1.0/bin; validation adds that directory to PATH. Amphora's scan then reports matching bounds, and the portable control changes from pass=45 skip=1 fail=0 to pass=47 skip=0 fail=0. This is a validation environment change, not a persistent host change.
obs The cold seed-link reading is 849 against 848. A candidate admitting template paths read 845, but sow_project.sh also copies only allow paths, so the candidate was withdrawn. The NixOS template carries key placeholders and personal annotations; Incense owns reconciling its intended projection with the allowlist.
obs The full sow witness passed after restoration: M1_OK, SOW_OK, IDENT_CLEAN, NO_PERSONAL, and SOW_WITNESS_GREEN. Public publishing remains at its existing custody gate.
obs The cold standing summary also names the older dated_path red and an unrostered fleet_drain run record. These are separate from the restored control.
obs Rebase met the peer's 20260909.025531 repair. Kept that published watcher and both modes whole; this lap's competing comment draft was withdrawn. The executable shell lines agree with the hot-tested version.
